#!RuleTest
#test FDA-CT2006 expect=noViolation domain=QS
#note "Under the value-level condition QSCAT='FUNC' the Define-XML binds QSTESTCD to a codelist whose WALK/GRIP terms decode to 'Walk Test'/'Grip Strength'; every record pairs code and decode correctly (row 3 is outside the value-level condition) -> no violation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#define-xml FDA-CT2006-define.xml
dataset QS class=FINDINGS label="Questionnaires"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col QSCAT    type=Char label="Category of Question"
col QSTESTCD type=Char label="Question Short Name"
col QSTEST   type=Char label="Question Name"
---
001 | FUNC  | WALK | Walk Test
001 | FUNC  | GRIP | Grip Strength
001 | OTHER | WALK | Some Other Name
